       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Order as written:** ibuprofen 1600 mg PO four times daily is 6,400 mg/day.\n- **Maximum dose:** The usual maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day under medical supervision. A single dose is typically no more than 800 mg.\n- **Risks:** This order is twice the daily maximum. It raises the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events, even in a patient with normal kidney and liver function.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg PO four times daily**, which is 3,200 mg/day and the usual maximum for anti-inflammatory dosing.\n- **1600 mg total per day**, for example 400 mg PO four times daily or 800 mg PO twice daily.\n- **Another dose or frequency.** Tell me what you intended.\n\nOnce you confirm the dose and frequency, I'll enter the order. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that explicitly. I'd suggest checking with pharmacy first."
